        "collapsible_text_AaPGYX": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "30-Day Price Guarantee",
            "content": "<p>If the price of your purchase changes <strong>within 30 days</strong> of your order, resulting in you paying more or missing out on a gift, please contact us. We will <strong>refund the price difference</strong> or send the complimentary gift.</p><p>*Only <strong>for orders starting after 24th, June, 2025</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_6TD6mx": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Main Specs & Dimensions",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>No Assemble</strong>, Ready To Use Out Of The Box</li><li>Small Office & Home Friendly</li><li>Running Area：<strong>15 x 36</strong> in</li><li>0-3-6-<strong>10% Incline</strong></li><li><strong>265 Lbs</strong> Capacity</li><li>Can Be Stored <strong>Vertically</strong></li><li><strong>Free App</strong> Subscription</li><li><strong>1-Year</strong> Warranty</li><li>One-Touch <strong>Mute Mode</strong></li><li>AI Voice Control | <strong>Remote Control</strong> | 3D VR</li><li>Speed of 1.0-4.0 mph(Adjustable)</li><li>Net Weight: 30 Lbs </li><li>Product Size: 42.9 x 18.3 x 4.1 in</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_FDU6H3": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "🎁 Order Early for a Stress-Free Holiday (Christmas Tips)",
            "content": "<p>Buying early means your gift won’t arrive late — and even if the recipient prefers something else, you’ll still have time to switch to a perfect Plan B.<br/>Ordering now also helps you avoid holiday shipping delays and ensures your treadmill arrives well before Christmas.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_etCW8W": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "30-Day Risk-Free Return & 1-Year Warranty Support",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>30-Day Return Window</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Enjoy a simple & <strong>hassle-free return</strong> process — WELLFIT will offer custmers a pre-paid return label when<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>applicable</strong></a>. Customers don't need to pay for the return shipping.</p><p>How the <strong>1-Year Warranty</strong> Works:</p><ul><li><strong>a)Part Replacement: </strong>Send us a video of the issue, and we'll ship the required parts along with step-by-step video instructions. </li><li><strong>b)Local Repair: </strong>If a local technician is more convenient, you may have the repair done locally with WELLFIT approval. Just send us a video of the issue before repair and a copy of the receipt after-we'll reimburse the cost.</li><li><strong>c)Free Replacement:</strong> If the product cannot be repaired during the warranty period, you will get a free replacement.</li><li><strong>d)Full or Partial Refund: </strong>If repair or replacement isn't feasible or preferred, we may offer a refund based on the product's condition and the issue's severity.</li><li><strong>e)Professional Support:</strong> We provide professional support with a dedicated technical team for online technical assistance.</li></ul><p><strong>*Note:</strong> WELLFIT will evaluate the actual situation and offer our customers best solution.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_4m76Jw": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tax-Free, No Extra Tax Added At Checkout",
            "content": "<p>Purchase directly from the WELLFIT treadmill official website and enjoy <strong>tax-free</strong> benefits, as WELLFIT will cover the sales tax. Consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>.  Compared with buying on other platforms, saving you more.Our official website also honors <strong>2-year </strong>free warranty, while other platform only offer 1-year limited warranty. Strong warranty protection for peace of mind</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_a96xbB": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Difference Between WP011 and WP009",
            "content": "<p>WP011 and WP009 have the same weight, load capacity and incline, the only difference is their size,material and appearance. The size of WP011 is 46.5x23x4.9 inches, while WP009 is 44.3x19.3x4.9 inches, so WP011 is a bit bigger than WP009. If you care about space, then WP009 is more suitable for you. WP011 is made of better material, and the appearance of WP011 is also more fashionable. WP011 also has a bigger screen.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_TCr478": {
